IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-A03.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(8).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(8).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 DST PIC S9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE VALUE 42.
01 FLAG PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    DISPLAY DST
    ADD 100 TO DST ON SIZE ERROR MOVE "H" TO FLAG END-ADD
    DISPLAY DST FLAG
    MOVE 42 TO DST
    DISPLAY DST
    ADD 100 TO DST END-ADD
    DISPLAY DST
    STOP RUN.
